WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.600
Camera, chat, shop, map… so many apps?

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.000
Nodbusiness brings them all together in one app.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.600
Post your photos and moments on your Personal feed.

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.000
Friends like, comment and chat with you.

5
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:25.866
Tap Build your mini website. No skills needed.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Choose your kind of business.

7
00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:32.000
Pick a ready-made template…

8
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.000
…and your website is ready in one tap.

9
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.000
Or start from scratch and add the parts you need with +.

10
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.900
Add a photo straight from your phone.

11
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.300
Type your business name and a few words.

12
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.900
Paste a link to your video or social pages.

13
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.200
Tap the days you are open.

14
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.500
Add products with a photo and a price.

15
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.400
Pick your colour.

16
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.500
It looks great on computer, tablet and phone.

17
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:21.500
Tap Publish: your website is live!

18
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:25.500
It appears in the Business feed for everyone to find.

19
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.500
Followers are told, and anyone can scan your QR code.

20
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:35.000
Customers order and send you messages.

21
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.900
They pay you directly. Nodbusiness never holds your money.

22
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.500
You confirm, and the order is done.

23
00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:46.800
Your life and your business, in one account.

24
00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:52.500
Nodbusiness: everything in one place. Start free.
